{"seq":4,"slug":"hydro-geothermal-emerging","title":"水电与新兴可再生能源","docCount":3,"url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging","docs":[{"seq":1,"slug":"hydropower-pumped-storage","title":"水力发电与抽水蓄能","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging/hydropower-pumped-storage","wordCount":1702,"readingTime":7},{"seq":2,"slug":"geothermal-energy","title":"地热能开发","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging/geothermal-energy","wordCount":1891,"readingTime":8},{"seq":3,"slug":"tidal-biomass-frontiers","title":"潮汐能与生物质能前沿","url":"/l-doc-books/h/climate-energy-transition/clean-energy/hydro-geothermal-emerging/tidal-biomass-frontiers","wordCount":2191,"readingTime":9}],"introHtml":"<h1 id=\"水电与新兴可再生能源\">水电与新兴可再生能源</h1><h2 id=\"概述\">概述</h2><p>水力发电是历史最悠久的清洁能源，抽水蓄能更是当前最成熟的大规模储能方案。本章同时覆盖地热能的深层开发潜力，以及潮汐能、生物质能等处于商业化前沿的新兴路线。</p>\n<h2 id=\"本章文档\">本章文档</h2><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>序号</th>\n<th>文档</th>\n<th>核心内容</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>水力发电与抽水蓄能</td>\n<td>常规水电站类型、抽水蓄能调峰原理、装机现状、生态影响</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>地热能开发</td>\n<td>浅层/中深层/增强型地热（EGS）、热泵应用、钻井技术与经济性</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>潮汐能与生物质能前沿</td>\n<td>潮汐/波浪能转换装置、生物质气化、可持续航空燃料（SAF）、规模化挑战</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"关键概念\">关键概念</h2><ul>\n<li><strong>抽水蓄能（Pumped Hydro Storage）</strong>：利用高低位水库势能差实现电力的时间搬移</li>\n<li><strong>EGS（Enhanced Geothermal System）</strong>：通过人工压裂在干热岩中创建地热交换系统</li>\n<li><strong>SAF（Sustainable Aviation Fuel）</strong>：满足航空脱碳需求的生物质/合成燃料</li>\n</ul>\n"}